{"seq":1,"slug":"asr-overview","title":"语音识别系统全景概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/foundations/asr-overview","wordCount":1658,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"语音识别系统全景概述\">语音识别系统全景概述</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ASR（Automatic Speech Recognition）</strong>：将语音信号自动转换为文本的技术，核心目标是最大化后验概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(W|X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>端到端模型（End-to-End）</strong>：直接学习音频到文本映射的神经网络，无需发音词典和独立语言模型</li>\n<li><strong>词错误率（WER）</strong>：ASR 系统的标准评测指标，衡量替换、删除、插入错误的归一化比率</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"asr-系统的核心任务与定义\">ASR 系统的核心任务与定义</h2><p>自动语音识别（Automatic Speech Recognition, ASR）的核心任务是将输入的语音信号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X = (x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 映射为对应的文本序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = (w_1, w_2, \\ldots, w_N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是音频帧数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是输出 token 数。从概率视角，ASR 系统求解的是后验概率最大化问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>W</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>W</mi></munder><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{W} = \\arg\\max_{W} P(W|X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4943em;vertical-align:-0.7443em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一看似简洁的公式背后隐含了语音技术数十年的演进。语音信号具有高度变异性——同一句话因说话人、语速、情绪、环境噪声的不同而呈现截然不同的声学表现。ASR 系统必须从这些变异中提取稳定的语言信息。</p>\n<p>从应用维度看，ASR 系统在 2026 年已渗透到多个核心场景：语音助手（Siri、Google Assistant）、会议转录（Otter.ai、飞书妙记）、字幕生成、客服质检、医疗记录、法律庭审记录等。全球 ASR 市场规模预计 2026 年超过 300 亿美元，年增长率超过 20%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"传统流水线架构\">传统流水线架构</h2><p>在端到端模型出现之前，ASR 系统采用模块化的流水线架构，各组件独立训练、级联工作：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[语音信号] --&gt; B[特征提取]&#10;    B --&gt; C[声学模型 AM]&#10;    C --&gt; D[发音词典]&#10;    D --&gt; E[语言模型 LM]&#10;    E --&gt; F[解码器]&#10;    F --&gt; G[文本输出]\">graph LR\n    A[语音信号] --&gt; B[特征提取]\n    B --&gt; C[声学模型 AM]\n    C --&gt; D[发音词典]\n    D --&gt; E[语言模型 LM]\n    E --&gt; F[解码器]\n    F --&gt; G[文本输出]</pre><p>各组件的职责如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>核心技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>特征提取</td>\n<td>原始波形</td>\n<td>MFCC/Fbank 特征序列</td>\n<td>短时傅里叶变换、梅尔滤波器组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声学模型</td>\n<td>特征帧序列</td>\n<td>音素/senone 后验概率</td>\n<td>GMM-HMM → DNN-HMM → TDNN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发音词典</td>\n<td>词条</td>\n<td>音素序列</td>\n<td>手工构建或 G2P 工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言模型</td>\n<td>词序列</td>\n<td>序列概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>n-gram → RNN-LM → Transformer-LM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解码器</td>\n<td>AM + LM 分数</td>\n<td>最优词序列</td>\n<td>WFST（加权有限状态转换器）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>传统系统的核心优势在于各模块可独立优化和替换，且语言模型可方便地适配不同领域。但其劣势同样明显：模块之间的优化目标不一致导致全局次优；发音词典的构建成本高且覆盖有限；级联误差会逐级放大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"端到端架构与范式转变\">端到端架构与范式转变</h2><p>2014 年之后，端到端（End-to-End, E2E）ASR 逐步取代传统流水线，成为学术和工业界的主流选择。E2E 模型直接学习从音频到文本的映射 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(W|X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，无需发音词典和独立的语言模型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 传统流水线&#10;        A1[波形] --&gt; A2[特征] --&gt; A3[AM] --&gt; A4[词典] --&gt; A5[LM] --&gt; A6[解码]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 端到端模型&#10;        B1[波形/特征] --&gt; B2[编码器 Encoder] --&gt; B3[解码器 Decoder] --&gt; B4[文本]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 传统流水线\n        A1[波形] --&gt; A2[特征] --&gt; A3[AM] --&gt; A4[词典] --&gt; A5[LM] --&gt; A6[解码]\n    end\n    subgraph 端到端模型\n        B1[波形/特征] --&gt; B2[编码器 Encoder] --&gt; B3[解码器 Decoder] --&gt; B4[文本]\n    end</pre><p>E2E ASR 的三种主要范式包括：</p>\n<p><strong>CTC（Connectionist Temporal Classification）</strong>：引入空白符号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle blank \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ank</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span>，通过边际化所有合法对齐路径计算输出概率。CTC 假设各帧输出条件独立，这简化了训练但限制了对上下文依赖的建模。</p>\n<p><strong>注意力机制（Attention-based Encoder-Decoder）</strong>：类似机器翻译的 seq2seq 架构。编码器将音频压缩为高层表示序列，解码器通过注意力权重逐步生成文本 token。其优势是能隐式学习对齐关系，劣势是在流式场景下难以应用。</p>\n<p><strong>RNN-T（Recurrent Neural Network Transducer）</strong>：结合了 CTC 的帧同步特性和注意力模型的上下文建模能力。通过联合网络（Joint Network）融合编码器和预测网络（Prediction Network）的输出，在流式场景中表现优异。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>对齐方式</th>\n<th>流式支持</th>\n<th>上下文建模</th>\n<th>典型代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CTC</td>\n<td>显式（帧独立）</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n<td>弱（独立假设）</td>\n<td>DeepSpeech、Jasper</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attention</td>\n<td>隐式（软对齐）</td>\n<td>需额外设计</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>LAS、Whisper</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RNN-T</td>\n<td>显式（单调）</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>Google USM、Emformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CTC/Attention 混合</td>\n<td>联合</td>\n<td>可支持</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>WeNet、ESPnet</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年-asr-技术图景\">2026 年 ASR 技术图景</h2><p>2026 年的 ASR 技术呈现多极发展格局。商业 API 层面，OpenAI Whisper-Large-V4 支持 99 种语言且 WER 显著下降（英语电话场景约 8.1%）；Deepgram Nova-4 以 180ms 中位延迟领先实时识别；AssemblyAI Universal-2 在说话人分离和合规场景占优。</p>\n<p>开源生态同样活跃。NVIDIA Canary-Qwen 2.5B 在 Hugging Face Open ASR Leaderboard 上以 5.63% 平均 WER 居首；IBM Granite Speech 3.3 8B 紧随其后（5.85% WER）；Alibaba Qwen3-ASR 覆盖 52 种语言。这些模型普遍采用 Conformer 或其变体作为编码器骨干。</p>\n<p>更深层的变革来自语音与大语言模型的融合。GPT-4o 的原生音频编码器直接处理声波信号而非先转文本，消除了级联误差并保留了韵律、情绪等副语言信息。这标志着 ASR 正从独立的转录工具向综合语音理解系统转变，传统 ASR→LLM→TTS 的三段式流水线正在被端到端的 Speech-to-Speech 模型取代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"系统设计的核心权衡\">系统设计的核心权衡</h2><p>构建生产级 ASR 系统需要在多个维度做出权衡决策：</p>\n<p><strong>准确性 vs 延迟</strong>：离线模型（如 Whisper）可利用完整上下文获得更高精度，但流式场景要求毫秒级响应。实践中常采用 look-ahead 窗口或 chunk-based 策略平衡两者。</p>\n<p><strong>通用性 vs 专业性</strong>：大规模多任务预训练模型（Whisper、USM）在通用场景表现优异，但特定领域（医疗、法律）的长尾术语仍需针对性适配。</p>\n<p><strong>模型规模 vs 部署成本</strong>：1.5B 参数的 Whisper Large 需约 10GB VRAM，而 Moonshine（27M-331M 参数）可在边缘设备运行，精度差距已缩小到可接受范围。</p>\n<p><strong>自建 vs 云服务</strong>：自建提供数据隐私和定制灵活性，云服务提供开箱即用的功能（说话人分离、PII 脱敏、情感检测）和持续更新。</p>\n<p>这些权衡没有标准答案，取决于具体业务场景的优先级排序。后续章节将逐一展开各维度的技术细节和最佳实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>ASR 技术从模块化流水线演进到端到端模型，2026 年已形成 Transformer 变体主导、自监督预训练加持、多模态 LLM 融合的格局。系统设计的核心在于根据业务场景在准确性、延迟、通用性、成本之间做出恰当权衡。理解传统架构各组件的职责和端到端模型的设计动机，是深入学习后续技术细节的基础。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"speech-signal-processing\">语音信号处理</a> 深入介绍从波形到特征的变换方法。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语音识别系统全景概述","id":"语音识别系统全景概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ASR 系统的核心任务与定义","id":"asr-系统的核心任务与定义"},{"level":2,"text":"传统流水线架构","id":"传统流水线架构"},{"level":2,"text":"端到端架构与范式转变","id":"端到端架构与范式转变"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年 ASR 技术图景","id":"2026-年-asr-技术图景"},{"level":2,"text":"系统设计的核心权衡","id":"系统设计的核心权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"语音信号处理与特征提取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/foundations/speech-signal-processing"}}